Paragraphing is an important part of this type of question, because it allows the reader to skip ahead and gives the answer some context before it is used in the question. Putting a space before the first mention of the word help make it easier for the reader to skip to the answer. If the question is asking for two particular words, you may also want to consider using *exactly* instead of *as* so that the two words are given in separate paragraphs.

